{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00600","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 永和 · 魏徵、褚亮","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 永和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於穆烈祖，弘此丕基。\n永言配命，子孙保之。\n百神既洽，万国在兹。\n是用孝享，神其格思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵、褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00600.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00600","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}